From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:33:03 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] libbluray: report the 2160p video size

StreamInfo.getVideoSize() has no break after the 2160p video format,
so it returns null for every UHD stream. VideoControl, the background
video and the PiP controls dereference that size when they clip, size
or place the video, so such an application throws NullPointerException.
---
 ...y-08-bdj-report-the-2160p-video-size.patch | 25 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 25 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 packages/multimedia/libbluray/patches/libbluray-08-bdj-report-the-2160p-video-size.patch

diff --git a/packages/multimedia/libbluray/patches/libbluray-08-bdj-report-the-2160p-video-size.patch b/packages/multimedia/libbluray/patches/libbluray-08-bdj-report-the-2160p-video-size.patch
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/multimedia/libbluray/patches/libbluray-08-bdj-report-the-2160p-video-size.patch
@@ -0,0 +0,25 @@
+From 00311d96f90ccaffd49857226a73a802f3e59923 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
+Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:43:00 -0500
+Subject: [PATCH] bdj: report the 2160p video size
+
+StreamInfo.getVideoSize() has no break after the 2160p video format,
+so it returns null for every UHD stream. VideoControl, the background
+video and the PiP controls dereference that size when they clip, size
+or place the video, so such an application throws NullPointerException.
+---
+ src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/StreamInfo.java | 1 +
+ 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
+
+diff --git a/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/StreamInfo.java b/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/StreamInfo.java
+index 4cf4fd4e15..61d6eeb2d2 100644
+--- a/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/StreamInfo.java
++++ b/src/libbluray/bdj/java/org/videolan/StreamInfo.java
+@@ -73,6 +73,7 @@ public class StreamInfo {
+         case (byte)0x08:
+             width = 3840;
+             height = 2160;
++            break;
+         default:
+                 return null;
+         }
